  "readme": "# Kenney Furniture Kit - ordinary household selection\n\nThree unmodified portable GLBs: bedSingle, table and bookcaseOpen.\nOriginal source: https://kenney.nl/assets/furniture-kit\nAuthor: Kenney. License: CC0 1.0 Universal; exact source License.txt retained.\n\nThe selected GLBs use glTF 2.0 and embedded material colours. They declare no\nexternal image textures. Their plain frames and broad faces suit the Paper\nTheatre reference after a small palette/paper-surface change. Check scene scale\nand pivots after private import; an edge bevel is optional. No electronics,\nmodern kitchen/bathroom fixtures, or redundant furniture variations are retained.\n\nAll three GLBs passed a separate Blender 5.2.2 LTS background import. Bed\nand bookcase stock-material renders were inspected. The bed imports only\n1.125 m long, the table 0.327 m high and the bookcase 0.880 m high; match\nfurniture scale to Elias before placement. The bed has three child meshes,\nso preserve its hierarchy when preparing a derived working copy. Source\nbytes and credit hashes remain unchanged. UE 4.27.2 validation is pending.\nPer-file dimensions, mesh/material details, hashes and roles are in SOURCE.json.\n",
